  "solution_html": "La raison de la suite arithmétique est \\(r = -2\\).\t<br>  On sait que \\(u_{10} = u_{9} + r\\).\t<br> Dans notre cas :\t \\(u_{10} = u_{9} - 2 = u_{9} - 2\\)<br>\\(u_{10} = u_{9} - 2 = 3 - 2 = 1\\),\t<br>\\(u_{11} = u_{10} - 2 = 1 - 2 = -1\\)<br>et \\(u_{12} = u_{11} - 2 = -1 - 2 = -3\\). \t\t "
